@startuml seq-broadcast
' Context: groups
' Profile: client
' SDD: SYS-GROUP, SYS-DELIVERY (erogazione asincrona)
' Revision: 2026-07-27

title Broadcast gruppo → archivio owner (client)

actor Utente
participant "GroupMessagesMachine" as GMM
participant "Supabase" as SB

Utente -> GMM : BroadcastToGroup
GMM -> SB : BroadcastToGroup
SB --> GMM : GroupBroadcastSent
GMM -> GMM : LoadGroupMessages
GMM --> Utente : GroupConversationUpdated

note right of SB
  Fan-out verso partecipanti allow list
  è asincrono nel contesto delivery
  (QueueGroupFanOut / GroupErogate) —
  non blocca il ritorno al client.
end note

@enduml
